      "created_at": "2025-09-01T14:14:38.334Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/nktech1135\">@nktech1135</a></p>\n<p>You cannot customize core fields which are programmed particularly But still property setter is where you can push your options and it may be chaotic.</p>\n<p>In this Particular instance, sales order types are programmed to meet particular purposes and without disturbing existing <em>order types</em>, you can insert your ones by setting up property setter record as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/8/a8fef6cffd1daf862ddbb8c168209ad3dd4ce078.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a8fef6cffd1daf862ddbb8c168209ad3dd4ce078\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a8fef6cffd1daf862ddbb8c168209ad3dd4ce078_2_690x471.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"o70tkGLiwCpIXwxZOxMEdk3cWco\" width=\"690\" height=\"471\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a8fef6cffd1daf862ddbb8c168209ad3dd4ce078_2_690x471.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a8fef6cffd1daf862ddbb8c168209ad3dd4ce078_2_1035x706.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/8/a8fef6cffd1daf862ddbb8c168209ad3dd4ce078.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1367×935 58.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>It will result as desired by reloading the page first.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/a/6a748edfd5d08a28e07dfc04a8a3f65c6ae3f99d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss